  "Description": [
    "Symlink and sync browser profile directories into RAM Profile-sync-daemon (psd) is a tiny pseudo-daemon designed to manage your browsers profile in tmpfs and periodically sync it back to disk. . This is accomplished by symlinking and the innovative use of rsync to maintain a backup and synchronization between tmpfs and disk. One of the major design goals of psd is a completely transparent user experience."
